@startuml Fluxo - SearXNG
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

title Fluxo — SearXNG (Meta-Buscador Privado)
caption Sidecar Tailscale · tráfego via network_mode: container:gluetun (ProtonVPN)

skinparam actor {
  BorderColor #4A148C
  FontColor #4A148C
  BackgroundColor #F3E5F5
}

actor "Usuário" as user
participant "Navegador" as browser
participant "Tailscale\nMesh VPN" as tailscale
participant "ts-searxng" as ts_searxng
participant "SearXNG\nCore" as searxng
participant "Gluetun VPN\n(ProtonVPN)" as gluetun
participant "Valkey Cache\n(vpn_net)" as searxng_valkey
participant "Mecanismos de\nbusca externos" as search_engines

group Passo 1: Usuário acessa via Tailscale
  user -> browser : "Acessa https://searxng.<TAILNET>.ts.net"
  browser -> tailscale : "Resolução DNS\n(mesh Tailscale)"
  tailscale -> ts_searxng : "HTTPS request"
  ts_searxng -> gluetun : "Proxy HTTP\nhttp://gluetun:8080"
  note right
    Sidecar na rede **vpn_net**.
    Proxy para gluetun:8080 porque
    SearXNG compartilha a rede do gluetun.
  end note
end

group Passo 2: SearXNG processa a busca
  gluetun -> searxng : "Porta 8080 (mesma\nrede do gluetun)"
  searxng -> searxng : "Categorias: web, imagens,\nvídeos, notícias, arquivos"
end

group Passo 3: Consultas saem pela VPN
  searxng -> gluetun : "Todo tráfego via\nnetwork_mode:\ncontainer:gluetun"
  gluetun -> internet : "WireGuard → ProtonVPN\nIP anônimo"
  internet -> search_engines : "Query sem IP real"
  search_engines --> gluetun : "Resultados"
  gluetun --> searxng : "Resposta"
end

group Passo 4: Cache e resposta
  searxng -> searxng_valkey : "Cache resultados\n(via vpn_net)"
  searxng --> user : "Página de resultados\n(sem tracking, sem perfil)"
end

note right
  **Mudanças recentes:**
  - Sidecar Tailscale substituiu o host-level serve
  - network_mode: container:gluetun (igual qBittorrent)
  - Proxy HTTP removido (redundante)
  - Valkey na vpn_net para resolução DNS
  Cache via Valkey. Rate limiting configurável.
end note

@enduml
